// 1. Define the base entities (Facts)
Fact user Identified by string.
Fact dataset Identified by string.
Fact package Identified by string.

// 2. Define the permission rule (Act)
// This represents the act of running your package on your dataset
Act run_minmax
  Actor user
  Recipient dataset
  Condition
    // The computation is ONLY allowed if the dataset is exactly "minmax_dataset" 
    // AND the user attempting to run it is exactly "Adam"
    Recipient == "minmax_dataset" && Actor == "Adam".

// 3. Populate the initial state of the policy engine
+user(Adam).
+user(Bob).
+dataset(minmax_dataset).
